font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n                    Mulberry, Dark grape, Pomelo, Prune, Black-tea like\n                   </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n                   入口是非常扎实的酸甜感，能感受到很多深色的莓果核果，像黑莓、桑葚和紫色的葡萄再到柚子西梅的多汁和甜以及夹杂着的微微的苦感，尾韵还有一些红茶感的甜，非常丰富有层次，它的酸甜扎实但是酸度并不是那种很刺激，可以大口大口的喝\n                  </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n                    特征关键词：深色莓果核果+柑橘+红茶感\n                   </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n               关于小乡村庄园 Aldea\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n              Wilson Ordoñez是第三代的咖啡种植者，他成功地将家族从种植传统咖啡转变为一家创新且成功的公司，专注于生产与别不同的精品咖啡。Wilson来自于一个传统的咖啡种植者家庭，他们致力生产小批量或知名的商业咖啡。Wilson从小就有创业的愿景，这就是为什么他为自己的生活理想寻找新的道路；\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9GIrEesw3aNl2I8Fdj5ibHJI8ls0TLiaA22lvr4b2Lic6HvgKmBPQlpKA5Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               Aldea目前种植有 Pink Bourbon、Tipica (Typica)、Caturra、Tabi、Geisha 和 Castillo 等品种；\n              </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9GpD63PYnYiaNaUs6jwjUJECKPuoVrNt73pSYyibfcEXErCS6GanU123vg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9GpiaibYZ4FedCGRwRIibszJnmECpcic2FdT3sAhtROMlXZBdg4IBbiavWZAQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                这个庄园之所以被命名为Aldea Coffee (小 乡村庄园)，是因为几年前它所在的城市 SanAgustín是一个小乡村，只有小房子和骑马出行的人们；\n               </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                 Aldea Coffee非常支持社区和年轻人的发展，因此他们为邻近的年轻妇女创造就业机会，从采摘、采收到挑选咖啡鲜果。咖啡收集区还为邻近咖啡种植家庭的年轻孩子提供了就业机会，让他们在那里学习生产和处理法的质量标准。\n                </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9GvafY4EFZwI2dYKuw0vERTkaqiaVMnMbMMEfhkIHCmgbMKeS0fSsg5BA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                 Aldea coffee通过创造就业机会以及与致力适应时代更替和为年轻人提供新机会的机构联合来支持经济，从而对该地区产生积极影响。同时他们还与Purutal project联合（Purutal project是一个家庭项目，由一个16 公顷的农场组成，其中约8公顷用于种植咖啡，其余部分正在种植新的物种），通过与该项目的联系，Aldea Coffee旨在帮助保护原始森林，同时也希望成为新的植树造林领头羊。\n                </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<span style='caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-variant-caps: normal;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9GxIsIUTBLWaSu8NyDrrXgHAfJg9KNH9S2b4mL6NFnc5UsaX7Muf2JFQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n              未来，Aldea Coffee 不仅希望成为当地生产处理的参考，还希望成为该地区新一代咖啡种植者的教学支持。目前，他们与哥伦比亚National Coffee Quality School联合，一起通过强化课程，了解从种子到杯子的重要性。\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9G1ZdCKxOvTsic6u6ARHdzibSDSYiccnfYOKwmhMzdMKWXMS7Ziaia7mBliaGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ToEu8Vo7boL4TwpwWDWH9GgOKRUF2rlyicAEdebJFgHPTrzcEuIJZsvwkCLksTBdmG4c9GZz1jycQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n               关于本批次处理\n              </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;list-style-type: circle;\">\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n                     这只瑰夏的处理过程相对复杂一些，处理过程简要：\n                    </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       鲜果采收，筛选\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       鲜果发酵，在发酵罐中发酵48小时\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       去果皮，使用之前收集的同品种的咖啡发酵液浸泡发酵100小时\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       发酵结束后，出桶清洗干净\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       晒床晾晒2周左右\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n                  ‍‍\n                 </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n              公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n              客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZfP6JRomfrYRJyo2D4Tf0NvibBUZu9UP4VMYvReaLlu6bc42JoO24Q